proteins, such as CUL1, CUL2, CUL3 and CUL4. Involved in cell proliferation."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}